  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n224 of 4 ÷ 7 - 250 × 3\n\n**Concept:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/47485e25d1b30c57dc271863db8b99be0c8e209069b2596cc885911d898a8a78.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ 224 of 4 ÷ 7 - 250 × 3\n\n⇒ 224 × 4 ÷ 7 - 750\n\n⇒ 896 ÷ 7 - 750\n\n⇒ 128 - 750\n\n⇒ -622\n\n**Hence, the value is -622.**",
